<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0046/e_0065> <http://digistrucmed.org/surfaceForm> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity/intravenous> .
